                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/997: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bailly-Blanchard</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-10-19T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 19,
                                1920—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>95. Your 78, October 16, 10 a.m.</p>
                <p>Department approves and desires that plan be put in operation at once.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
